{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"'Sabrine Lovlatar... is just an alias I've been using. My real name - or at least, the one I considered real when I woke up - is Sab Louhi. But either or neither of those could be my original name... it's the only leads I have, though.'","created_at":"2021-08-11T20:05:22.276000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875107649170047037","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
