{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"\"Sab Louhi is a pretty name... it's alright by me, a rose still smells the same by a different name, so do not worry about me\"","created_at":"2021-08-11T20:07:22.251000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875108152381685850","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"she looks slightly relieved, before paling again as she speaks, '...the reason I ask, and please, let me tell people this at my own pace... I remembered my younger sister. But just- that she existed, and that she died, not even her name...' she's clearly hiding some details.","created_at":"2021-08-11T20:08:51.173000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875108525347598358","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"\"I suppose that'll be something to look into in greater detail eventually. When other stuff is taken care of. So what's up with your airship?\"","created_at":"2021-08-11T20:12:29.767000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875109442197282838","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"(I guess back to the intermission void for now)","created_at":"2021-08-11T20:16:22.528000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875110418467676170","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
